Z||000000||Haze_Performance||07-05-2000||12:36 AM||||Lets see if I have this right. A 85 GT front bumper will bolt right up to my 85 Coupe? Or A 86 to 88 SE will be the same right?? I have the square molding all the way around, so I would like to just keep it that way. <P>------------------<BR>Carl (85 Fiero) My Website's  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/HMP" TARGET=_blank>Haze Mustang Performance</A>   &  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/WS6_Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero</A>||||reg||14
Z||000001||cifc||07-05-2000||12:56 AM||||Also an 84 Indy.  You might also have to change the energy absorber behind the cover.<BR>--Jason||||reg||1
Z||000002||stimpy||07-05-2000||06:28 AM||||You would need to change the wheel well liners or have a gap between the wheelwell and the bumperskin.||||reg||1
Z||000003||BellaFiero||07-05-2000||12:28 PM||||I've got a 1988 Standard Coupe that had the traditional pointy noise. Never did care for that style... but I wouldn't refuse one if someone gave it to me either  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I took the nose from a bombed-out 86 SE Aero style and put it on mine. It was a bit of pain getting the Aero nose on, but a little bit of imagination made it work just fine. There is about an inch gap between the hood and the edge of the nose, I was hoping it would go flush... but lo-and-behold! Wolf Bra came to my rescue... their bra for the Aero nose covers the gap and any small quirks that came from mounting it. It looks quite good - you can't really tell it didn't come from the factory like that. I don't want to go around spreading false rumors, but I'm fairly certain, if you're willing to go with a sports bra for your car, that you could make any bumper fit any year. Just a little a little bit of customization is in order... if anyone ever needs help in getting a bumper to fit, give me a holler. Camaros and Firebirds dread me and my gear-head friends when it comes to bumpers and spoilers  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||12
Z||000004||lawrence||07-06-2000||08:08 AM||||I think you're on to something.  Get a bra that fits onto the car you like, fill it with expanding foam, and viola!  Bumper of choice!<P>-L<BR>  <A HREF="http://members.nccw.net/webe" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nccw.net/webe</A>  - WebElectric Magazine||||reg||1
